[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7696.229, "timestamp": "02:08:16", "text": "或者我们应该至少把所有黄蜂都杀掉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7699.589, "timestamp": "02:08:19", "text": "然后撤离？ 或许。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7700.87, "timestamp": "02:08:20", "text": "但问题就在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7702.709, "timestamp": "02:08:22", "text": "附近没有黄蜂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7706.87, "timestamp": "02:08:26", "text": "H：哦，我的枪快要坏了。 不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7712.149, "timestamp": "02:08:32", "text": "它在哪里？ 哪里是？ 什么是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7714.79, "timestamp": "02:08:34", "text": "生成物？ 刚才刷新了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7718.39, "timestamp": "02:08:38", "text": "呃，不是你。 你在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7720.709, "timestamp": "02:08:40", "text": "告密者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7724.629, "timestamp": "02:08:44", "text": "好吧，让我先干掉这个告密者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7727.83, "timestamp": "02:08:47", "text": "哦，就在附近。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7730.47, "timestamp": "02:08:50", "text": "糟糕，有两只黄蜂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7733.35, "timestamp": "02:08:53", "text": "等等，什么东西在上升？"}]